      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I could easily see more known users in the community being constantly spammed with invite invitations if this was implemented, just like well known world authors are bombarded by friend requests since the update to the world GUI to more easily access their social profile.\nIf this were to be implemented then a option to not see non-friend invites must be in place.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5c86bc3399f83c3d853e34c7",
      "author": {
        "_id": "58e9b53451054109b5a20b80",
