      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: This is very true, I was thinking the status feature set to busy would help if one is receiving invites en masse but I can see why this wouldn’t be a complete solution either. Tbh a toggleable option would be totally good to me as well. I’d even be down to see invite requests not require friendship if it’s toggleable.",
