      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe one option they could do is having a setting saying \"Invite Requests From Friends Only\" and have it ticked on by default.\n\nI know for sure I love the concept of getting a whole bunch of people together because fun in numbers and all that jazz but I always hate the thought of having to add everyone myself and inflating up my friends list with people that I'll probably forget to delete.",
